HOUSE MADE HOSPITALITY

House Made Hospitality is a major hospitality group operating in Sydney. House Made Hospitality believes in warm service, great ingredients, beautiful design, a curated ambience, a sense of place, authenticity, doing good, a conscious culture, and heaps of fun.

House Made Hospitality are the creators of Hinchcliff House, a 4-level dining, drinking and entertainment venue in the Sydney CBD, set within a heritage wool store in Circular Quay. Hinchcliff House encompasses Grana Restaurant, Lana Restaurant, Apollonia Bar, Bar Mammoni and Level Two function area.

Also part of House Made Hospitality are This Way Canteen and Martinez Restaurant in the Sydney CBD region, The Carrington in Surry Hills and Promenade Bondi and Etheus, located in the popular Bondi Beach area.

Martinez overlooks Sydney harbour with a bright and breezy venue and a French Riviera-inspired menu. Promenade Bondi Beach is located in the old Bondi Pavilion and incorporates formal restaurant dining, an open-aired terrace, bar, cafe and beach kiosk, while the nearby Etheus offers a Greek menu that is fire-led and full of flavour in a sun-drenched and unpretentious setting. The Carrington is a well-known local with delicious pub food and a mix of indoor and outdoor dog-friendly spaces.

The latest additions to the House Made Hospitality are located in the new Wunderlich Lane district in Surry Hills. Island Radio is a new Asian-inspired eating-house and noodle bar, while the new Vitelli's Upstairs is an Italian restaurant that takes cues from old New York red-sauce joints.

THE ROLE

House Made Hospitality is seeking an experienced Accountant to joint our finance team at our head office location in Circular Quay, Sydney. Reporting to the Head of Finance, the Accountant position will be responsible for managing the accounts of all venues and businesses within the group.

The Accountant for House Made Hospitality will manage group financial operations, oversee accounting policies compliance and reporting deadlines and assist with financial reporting and analysis.

As Accountant for House Made Hospitality, you will be responsible for:
-  day-to-day record keeping and reconciliations;
-  managing accounts payable & receivable functions;
-  payroll workflow;
-  financial reporting and month-end close;
-  supporting cash-flow forecasting;
-  preparing BAS, GST & payroll tax submissions;
-  maintaining accurate financial records;
-  assisting in internal & external audits;
-  supporting financial process improvements;
-  liaising with stakeholder on financial queries;
-  general ledger maintenance;
-  supporting budget preparation & monitoring; and
-  ensuring compliance with accounting standards.

Full-Time Salary: $80,000 - $90,000

ABOUT YOU:

To be successful in this position, you will need to have:
-  appropriate tertiary qualifications in Accounting/Business/Finance;
-  CA/CPA registration preferred;
-  at least 2+ years experience in a similar role;
-  experience with accounting work for private organisations;
-  experience in the hospitality sector highly advantageous;
-  proficiency in accounting software and strong Excel/computer skills;
-  demonstrated knowledge of Australian accounting standards and regulations;
-  confidence working with people in all levels of business;
-  high attention to detail;
-  exceptional time management and organisational skills and the ability to manage competing priorities;
-  excellent communication skills;
-  analytical and problem-solving skills;
-  willingness to take initiative
-  experience with weekly/monthly/yearly financial reporting;
-  ability to work independently and as part of a team; and
-  commitment to learning and growing on the job.

ABOUT US

House Made Hospitality is a Sydney-based and globally-inspired hospitality group, with people, quality and care at heart. Our ambition is to build unique concepts that create a sense of place and deliver a great experience. Our focus is on how people feel in our venues. Our culture is consistent with humility, generosity and warmth at its core. Our passion is what we do, and we enjoy every bit of it.

Our venues currently include Hinchcliff House, Promenade Bondi, This Way Canteen, Etheus, Martinez Restaurant & Bar, The Carrington, Island Radio and Vitelli's Upstairs - with many more to come.

If this sounds like the opportunity for you, please APPLY NOW.
